WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:04.054
Alice was beginning to get very tired of sitting by her sister on the bank,

2
00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:08.905
and of having nothing to do: once or twice she had peeped into the book her sister was reading,

3
00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:13.600
but it had no pictures or conversations in it, “and what is the use of a book,” thought Alice “without

4
00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.184
pictures or conversations?”

5
00:00:15.401 --> 00:00:20.087
So she was considering in her own mind (as well as she could, for the hot day made her feel

6
00:00:20.097 --> 00:00:25.022
very sleepy and stupid), whether the pleasure of making a daisy-chain would be worth the trouble of getting up and

7
00:00:25.032 --> 00:00:29.163
picking the daisies, when suddenly a White Rabbit with pink eyes ran close by her.
